{
  "version": "0.1.1",
  "slug": "select",
  "title": "Select",
  "group": "Inputs",
  "order": 8,
  "summary": {
    "en": "A field-shaped button that opens a list of options below it and shows the one chosen. For one choice from a fixed list too long to show as radios; if people need to type to find it, use a combobox.",
    "id": "Tombol berbentuk kolom yang membuka daftar opsi di bawahnya dan menampilkan yang dipilih. Untuk satu pilihan dari daftar tetap yang terlalu panjang untuk ditampilkan sebagai radio; jika orang perlu mengetik untuk menemukannya, pakai combobox."
  },
  "titleId": "Select",
  "react": true,
  "examples": {
    "en": [
      {
        "title": "Choose a district",
        "desc": "Click or press Enter, Space or Down to open; arrows move; Enter picks; Escape closes; typing jumps to the first option starting with the letters.",
        "html": "<div class=\"field\" style=\"max-width: 360px; width: 100%;\">\n  <span class=\"field__label\" id=\"se-level\">District (kecamatan)</span>\n  <div class=\"select\" data-lds-select>\n    <button type=\"button\" class=\"control select-trigger is-placeholder\" aria-haspopup=\"listbox\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-labelledby=\"se-level\"><span class=\"select__value\">Choose a district</span><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">expand_more</span></button>\n    <ul class=\"menu select__menu\" role=\"listbox\" aria-labelledby=\"se-level\">\n      <li class=\"menu__item\" role=\"option\" aria-selected=\"false\" data-value=\"kedaton\"><span class=\"select__text\">Kedaton<small>Bandar Lampung</small></span></li>\n      <li class=\"menu__item\" role=\"option\" aria-selected=\"false\" data-value=\"way-halim\"><span class=\"select__text\">Way Halim<small>Bandar Lampung</small></span></li>\n      <li class=\"menu__item\" role=\"option\" aria-selected=\"false\" data-value=\"metro-pusat\"><span class=\"select__text\">Metro Pusat<small>Kota Metro</small></span></li>\n      <li class=\"menu__item\" role=\"option\" aria-selected=\"false\" data-value=\"pringsewu\"><span class=\"select__text\">Pringsewu<small>Kabupaten Pringsewu</small></span></li>\n    </ul>\n  </div>\n</div>"
      },
      {
        "title": "With an icon and a chosen value",
        "desc": "A filter bar select, chosen already. The check marks the selected row in the list.",
        "html": "<div class=\"field\" style=\"max-width: 260px; width: 100%;\">\n  <span class=\"field__label\" id=\"se-sem\">Report period</span>\n  <div class=\"select\" data-lds-select>\n    <button type=\"button\" class=\"control select-trigger\" aria-haspopup=\"listbox\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-labelledby=\"se-sem\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">calendar_month</span><span class=\"select__value\">Q3 2026</span><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">expand_more</span></button>\n    <ul class=\"menu select__menu\" role=\"listbox\" aria-labelledby=\"se-sem\">\n      <li class=\"menu__item is-selected\" role=\"option\" aria-selected=\"true\" data-value=\"2026-q3\">Q3 2026</li>\n      <li class=\"menu__item\" role=\"option\" aria-selected=\"false\" data-value=\"2026-q2\">Q2 2026</li>\n      <li class=\"menu__item\" role=\"option\" aria-selected=\"false\" data-value=\"2026-q1\">Q1 2026</li>\n      <li class=\"menu__item\" role=\"option\" aria-selected=\"false\" data-value=\"2025-q4\">Q4 2025</li>\n    </ul>\n  </div>\n</div>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Required and missing",
        "desc": "The trigger is a `.control`, so the error state is the same as any field.",
        "html": "<div class=\"field\" style=\"max-width: 360px; width: 100%;\">\n  <span class=\"field__label\" id=\"se-cat\">Complaint type</span>\n  <div class=\"select\" data-lds-select>\n    <button type=\"button\" class=\"control select-trigger is-placeholder is-invalid\" aria-haspopup=\"listbox\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-labelledby=\"se-cat\" aria-invalid=\"true\" aria-describedby=\"se-cat-help\"><span class=\"select__value\">Choose a type</span><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">expand_more</span></button>\n    <ul class=\"menu select__menu\" role=\"listbox\" aria-labelledby=\"se-cat\">\n      <li class=\"menu__item\" role=\"option\" aria-selected=\"false\" data-value=\"jalan\">Damaged road</li>\n      <li class=\"menu__item\" role=\"option\" aria-selected=\"false\" data-value=\"lampu\">Street light out</li>\n      <li class=\"menu__item\" role=\"option\" aria-selected=\"false\" data-value=\"sampah\">Uncollected rubbish</li>\n    </ul>\n  </div>\n  <span class=\"field__help field__help--error\" id=\"se-cat-help\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">error</span>Choose a complaint type so the report reaches the right agency.</span>\n</div>"
      }
    ],
    "id": [
      {
        "title": "Pilih kecamatan",
        "desc": "Klik atau tekan Enter, Spasi, atau Bawah untuk membuka; panah berpindah; Enter memilih; Escape menutup; mengetik huruf melompat ke opsi pertama yang diawali huruf itu.",
        "html": "<div class=\"field\" style=\"max-width: 360px; width: 100%;\">\n  <span class=\"field__label\" id=\"se-level\">Kecamatan</span>\n  <div class=\"select\" data-lds-select>\n    <button type=\"button\" class=\"control select-trigger is-placeholder\" aria-haspopup=\"listbox\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-labelledby=\"se-level\"><span class=\"select__value\">Pilih kecamatan</span><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">expand_more</span></button>\n    <ul class=\"menu select__menu\" role=\"listbox\" aria-labelledby=\"se-level\">\n      <li class=\"menu__item\" role=\"option\" aria-selected=\"false\" data-value=\"kedaton\"><span class=\"select__text\">Kedaton<small>Bandar Lampung</small></span></li>\n      <li class=\"menu__item\" role=\"option\" aria-selected=\"false\" data-value=\"way-halim\"><span class=\"select__text\">Way Halim<small>Bandar Lampung</small></span></li>\n      <li class=\"menu__item\" role=\"option\" aria-selected=\"false\" data-value=\"metro-pusat\"><span class=\"select__text\">Metro Pusat<small>Kota Metro</small></span></li>\n      <li class=\"menu__item\" role=\"option\" aria-selected=\"false\" data-value=\"pringsewu\"><span class=\"select__text\">Pringsewu<small>Kabupaten Pringsewu</small></span></li>\n    </ul>\n  </div>\n</div>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Dengan ikon dan nilai terpilih",
        "desc": "Select di bilah filter yang sudah dipilih. Tanda centang menandai baris terpilih di daftar.",
        "html": "<div class=\"field\" style=\"max-width: 260px; width: 100%;\">\n  <span class=\"field__label\" id=\"se-sem\">Periode laporan</span>\n  <div class=\"select\" data-lds-select>\n    <button type=\"button\" class=\"control select-trigger\" aria-haspopup=\"listbox\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-labelledby=\"se-sem\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">calendar_month</span><span class=\"select__value\">Triwulan III 2026</span><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">expand_more</span></button>\n    <ul class=\"menu select__menu\" role=\"listbox\" aria-labelledby=\"se-sem\">\n      <li class=\"menu__item is-selected\" role=\"option\" aria-selected=\"true\" data-value=\"2026-q3\">Triwulan III 2026</li>\n      <li class=\"menu__item\" role=\"option\" aria-selected=\"false\" data-value=\"2026-q2\">Triwulan II 2026</li>\n      <li class=\"menu__item\" role=\"option\" aria-selected=\"false\" data-value=\"2026-q1\">Triwulan I 2026</li>\n      <li class=\"menu__item\" role=\"option\" aria-selected=\"false\" data-value=\"2025-q4\">Triwulan IV 2025</li>\n    </ul>\n  </div>\n</div>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Wajib dan belum diisi",
        "desc": "Pemicunya adalah `.control`, jadi status galatnya sama dengan kolom lainnya.",
        "html": "<div class=\"field\" style=\"max-width: 360px; width: 100%;\">\n  <span class=\"field__label\" id=\"se-cat\">Jenis pengaduan</span>\n  <div class=\"select\" data-lds-select>\n    <button type=\"button\" class=\"control select-trigger is-placeholder is-invalid\" aria-haspopup=\"listbox\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-labelledby=\"se-cat\" aria-invalid=\"true\" aria-describedby=\"se-cat-help\"><span class=\"select__value\">Pilih jenis</span><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">expand_more</span></button>\n    <ul class=\"menu select__menu\" role=\"listbox\" aria-labelledby=\"se-cat\">\n      <li class=\"menu__item\" role=\"option\" aria-selected=\"false\" data-value=\"jalan\">Jalan rusak</li>\n      <li class=\"menu__item\" role=\"option\" aria-selected=\"false\" data-value=\"lampu\">Lampu jalan padam</li>\n      <li class=\"menu__item\" role=\"option\" aria-selected=\"false\" data-value=\"sampah\">Sampah tidak terangkut</li>\n    </ul>\n  </div>\n  <span class=\"field__help field__help--error\" id=\"se-cat-help\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">error</span>Pilih jenis pengaduan agar laporan sampai ke dinas yang tepat.</span>\n</div>"
      }
    ]
  },
  "reactUsage": "import { Select } from 'lampung-design-system/react';\n\n<span className=\"field__label\" id=\"level-label\">District (kecamatan)</span>\n<Select\n  labelledBy=\"level-label\"\n  value={level}\n  onChange={setLevel}\n  placeholder=\"Choose a district\"\n  options={[\n    { value: 'kedaton', label: 'Kedaton', sub: 'Bandar Lampung' },\n    { value: 'way-halim', label: 'Way Halim', sub: 'Bandar Lampung' },\n  ]}\n/>",
  "related": [
    "combobox",
    "radio-card",
    "segmented-control",
    "dropdown-menu"
  ]
}
